2026-09-01,159044">Inspect the source data</a></p><p class="chart-vintage">Bureau of Labor Statistics payroll counts, from the St. Louis Fed's FRED database as published October 3, 2026; later releases may revise the counts.</p><details class="chart-values"><summary>Read the values and calculation</summary><p>Each bar subtracts the previous month's total jobs from that month's total. The database reports totals in thousands.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Month</th><th scope="col">Jobs gained or lost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">October 2025</th><td><a href="/records/fred-payems-2026-10-03/" data-passage="2025-09-01,158548
