></div><h1 class=gnt_ar_hl elementtiming=ar-headline>September jobs report shows slowdown in hiring, unemployment ticks up</h1><div class=gnt_ar_by><a href=/staff/72408829007/rachel-barber/ data-t-l=":byline with photo|o|c|text" class="gnt_ar_by_a gnt_ar_by_a__fi"><img class=gnt_ar_by_i src="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2025/02/27/USAT/80579975007-image-16.jpg?crop=768,768,x0,y0&width=48&height=48&format=pjpg&auto=webp" srcset="/gcdn/authoring/authoring-images/2025/02/27/USAT/80579975007-image-16.jpg?crop=768,768,x0,y0&width=96&height=96&format=pjpg&auto=webp 2x" decoding=async loading=eager alt="Portrait of Rachel Barber" fetchpriority=high data-t-l=":byline with photo|o|c|photo"/> Rachel Barber</a><div class=gnt_ar_pb>USA TODAY</div></div><div class=gnt_ar_dt>Updated Oct. 2, 2026, 9:36 a.m. ET</div><div class=gnt_ar_tl_w><div class="gnt_em gnt_ar_hts" data-u-sr=sub><button class=gnt_ar_hts_cta data-g-r=base_htsl><svg viewBox="0 0 21 22" class=gnt_ar_hts_svg><path d="M0 11.65c0 1 .1 2.02.28 3.05a20 20 0 0 0 .79 3.04c.34 1 .75 1.91 1.24 2.76.14.26.35.43.6.5a1 1 0 0 0 .8-.13.94.94 0 0 0 .49-.6 1.1 1.1 0 0 0-.12-.83 16.62 16.62 0 0 1-1.5-3.8 15.96 15.96 0 0 1-.52-3.99c0-1.33.2-2.54.58-3.63a8.1 8.1 0 0 1 1.64-2.8 7.27 7.27 0 0 1 2.55-1.8 8.31 8.31 0 0 1 3.3-.63c1.2 0 2.3.2 3.28.63a7.25 7.25 0 0 1 2.56 1.8 8.1 8.1 0 0 1 1.64 2.8c.38 1.09.58 2.3.58 3.63a16 16 0 0 1-.53 4 16.62 16.62 0 0 1-1.49 3.8c-.15.27-.2.54-.13.81s.23.48.48.61a1 1 0 0 0 .8.13 1 1 0 0 0 .62-.5 19.15 19.15 0 0 0 2.31-8.85c0-1.63-.24-3.12-.73-4.47a9.81 9.81 0 0 0-2.06-3.46 9 9 0 0 0-3.2-2.23A10.51 10.51 0 0 0 10.13.7C8.6.7 7.2.97 5.97 1.5a9.1 9.1 0 0 0-3.2 2.22A9.91 9.91 0 0 0 .71 7.18 13.19 13.19 0 0 0 0 11.66Zm3.38 8.6c.18.58.5 1 .96 1.24.47.25 1 .28 1.6.1.59-.18 1-.51 1.25-1 .25-.47.28-1 .1-1.6l-1.4-4.6c-.18-.59-.5-1-.98-1.25-.47-.25-1-.29-1.58-.1a2 2 0 0 0-1.26.99 2.05 2.05 0 0 0-.09 1.6l1.4 4.61Zm13.5 0 1.39-4.61c.18-.6.15-1.13-.1-1.61a2.02 2.02 0 0 0-1.25-1 2.02 2.02 0 0 0-1.59.1 2 2 0 0 0-.96