None. I found no **new** defect to number, and no patched finding that still survives on this page. The recurring proposed changes in earlier reviews are either addressed or on the [editor’s held list](/Volumes/4/GitHub/the-catch-site-wt-jobs-sept/checks/working-notes/jobs--2026-10-02-september-payrolls-rise-29000-held.md).

## Holes

No unanswered question with an available record changes this story. September gross hires remain unpublished, and the page says so. The cause of the 29,000 estimate is unknown in the pinned record, and the page states that limit. The next Fed decision remains ahead of the page’s date.

## The budget

About **700 words now**; **0** removed; **0** added.

## Decision

No numbered item is Critical, Major, or Minor. The piece is current, and the story view carries the reader model’s consequential passages.

