## The top

The headline withstands the easy misreading of **29,000** as a settled payroll change, although “survey” arrives before the survey explanation. The dek gives the bureau’s assessment and the revisions. The first body sentence says what happened. Nobody is named before introduction. The cold top works; the false rebuttal comes later.

